## ⚠️ Important Cryptographic Disclaimer

This code functions natively as a local split-trust prototype model. In an enterprise web architecture deployment, the `SERVER_KEY_PART` should be securely migrated over an TLS tunnel to an isolated database service or dedicated Hardware Security Module (HSM), while the `USER_KEY_PART` processing layers remain restricted to client-side compute limits (e.g., via WebCrypto API).
